From 1d250c0211eab1abcd0cae89a051219c75203173 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:51:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] One control row on lane, theme and person pages and user
 lists (rule 1800)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Owner-approved b74-list-controls option B. The Unseen / Seen / All segment, the
Sort / Filters / grid-list row and the "N you have not seen, best first." sentence
become one row: "34 unseen ▾" (MenuPopover with Unseen / Seen / All; the count
follows the choice), "Best for you ▾" with no "Sort" prefix and the direction in
its menu (Highest first / Lowest first), Filters, and one ⋯ that gains
Show as list / Show as grid. When the row does not fit, Sort and Filters wrap
under the count, left-aligned, with the ⋯ pinned at the far right. Signed out: "41 films" muted, no ▾, no ⋯. User lists get the
same row, "Any" renamed "All". TagModel.caption retired. Web and iPhone (Swift
not compiled here). Rules 244, 1082, 1224, 1280, 1345, 1360 and 1364 checks
amended for the new row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013WRDCFXH8nihP92apJAVW7
